WEBVTT

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:14.530
Rio Rainbow Gate Episode 2

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.510
Have a lucky day.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.160
Rio! You were fantastic!

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.970
And those clothes are fantastic.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.550
Choco's crazy for them, too.

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.810
Thank you, Mint, but...

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:50.850
But why do I have to perform in a dance show?

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.550
I'm going to give the owner a piece of my mind.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:02:00.920
You're a dealer, so you only want to do a dealer's work.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.990
Is that what you're saying, Rio?

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.000
Yes, Howard.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.700
That's perfect.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.320
What?

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:09.240
Huh?

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:11.450
Come here.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.530
Allow me to introduce you.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:18.120
This is Ania Helsing from Russia.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.820
Nice to meet you, Rio-senpai.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.860
Rio-senpai?

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.090
It's an honor to meet you.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:30.990
Gate Holder

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:31.510
What?

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:33.390
Training recruits?

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:36.970
She's got potential, but she's inexperienced.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:40.490
Rio, I want you to train her.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:41.510
What?

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:48.030
I'm delighted to be taught by Howard Resort's Goddess of Victory!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.570
I look forward to working with you!

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:52.430
Uh, but...

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.850
What?

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.880
I thought you wanted to do a dealer's work.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.770
Training your juniors is one of your responsibilities.

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.840
I know, but...

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.490
Oh, that's right.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.550
We're starting a new show next month.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:12.500
I was hoping you'd...

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.330
I've always wanted to train a new recruit!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.220
I'll do my best!

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:18.590
I see.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.770
Wow!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:27.500
This is Rio-senpai's room...

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:33.550
Why don't you show me what you can do?

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:35.100
Yes!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:44.480
Oh, my.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:46.680
She's pretty good.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:50.040
It doesn't look like I'll have anything to teach you.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.620
That's not true. I still need a lot of work.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.270
Your card skills pass.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:58.100
Let's see how you do at the roulette.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.900
Um...

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.630
That's a gate, isn't it?

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.150
I'm impressed!

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:06.220
I've never seen the real thing before!

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:08.100
Gate?

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:11.350
Rio-senpai. you're a gate holder!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:15.200
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.730
What's a gate holder?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.400
What? You mean you don't know?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.080
Sorry about that...

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:24.910
The international dealer's organization.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.600
The International Casino Dealer's Guild.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:31.220
The gates are thirteen cards issued by the organization.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:34.080
The gates were distributed throughout the world.

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:41.980
Dealers who have them are known as gate holders...

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:47.440
and gate holders challenge each other by betting their own gates.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:51.720
In other words, they have gate battles!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:56.520
The dealer who collects all thirteen gates will be named...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:05:01.910
the strongest dealer by the guild!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.620
Amazing!

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:07.410
You must be amazing to have such a rare card!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.380
I'm not amazing.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.060
Someone gave this to me.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.260
What? Your gate?

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:17.970
Yes. I once played a game for a customer in a casino.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.300
It was then...

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.660
Miss, that was a spectacular game...

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.160
Allow me to give you this.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.220
You are worthy to hold it.

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.160
There's nothing amazing about it.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:48.890
But you're pursuing the title of strongest dealer, aren't you?

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:53.790
Yeah. It might be just a dream, though...

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:01.390
Let's see you handle the roulette.

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:03.300
Yes, Rio-senpai!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.290
Are you okay?

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.890
I'm fine.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.840
This always... happens... to...

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.840
Ouch...

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.800
She's tripping over herself...

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:22.210
Are you all right?

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.880
I'm fine...

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.150
90 degrees Fahrenheit!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.090
30% humidity!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.250
Winds South-Southwest at 4 yards!

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:38.500
These are optimal driving conditions...

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:42.440
Don't you think so, member number 2121?

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.110
Of course, Elvis-sama!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.420
The truth of equations and the consistency of physics...

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:53.920
That's right! There is a reason to everything!

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:59.550
Just as it was no coincidence I met the members of my fan club!

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.970
Oh, Elvis-sama!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:09.220
Cutie, you are meant to meet me as well..

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:13.130
And you are meant to lose, too!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.520
I'm coming. Please excuse me.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.300
I hope she's all right...

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.220
Rio-chan?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:31.290
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.620
Rio-senpai...

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.040
She's really clumsy...

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.210
I'm exhausted.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.740
Ania-san...

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.620
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.260
What's going on?

00:08:01.260 --> 00:08:02.510
I'm sorry!

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:07.680
Wait!

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.830
Ready, start!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:12.080
Start.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.620
What's going on?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.910
Going on?

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:25.310
Damn it.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.080
I can't seem to win.

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:31.530
What's all this racket?

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:42.050
Please... stop... me...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.680
Awesome!

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.020
You're the best!

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.800
Thank you...

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:57.550
Rio, aren't you supposed to be training her?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.620
She's unbelievably clumsy.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.510
Unbelievably.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.220
Let's go.

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.430
I still have work to do...

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:08.070
Don't be a cheapskate!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:10.340
Come on! Let's go there next!

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:14.390
She's loveable.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:31.530
Where is my cutie of destiny?

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:36.200
Seven, seven, seven!

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:41.360
You shouldn't scowl when playing the numbers.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.520
Throw the dice like you're sending off a cutie.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.210
See?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.120
Elvis-sama, you're amazing.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:55.250
The numbers are always on my side.

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:59.290
They won't match up at all.

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:04.290
Let me give this beautiful lady some luck...

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:12.940
Tonight you'll learn to dine on a low Engel's coefficient.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:16.170
Elvis-sama, you're too kind.

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:26.330
Coefficient of friction and angle of reflection.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.720
Reflection coefficient and angle of separation.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.500
Fear my beautiful masse.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.850
Elvis-sama, you're so cool!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.260
Maybe I'm playing around too much.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:42.060
Now to find that cutie...

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.790
I did it again...

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.080
Are you all right?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:51.460
Yes! Thank you for your concern!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.660
I'll take care of this, so don't worry about it!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.330
Elvis-sama, you're so kind!

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:01.500
Are you all right?

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:03.800
Sir!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.460
Elvis-sama!

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.370
Oh, no...

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.140
It's nothing to worry about, cutie.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:13.080
This is just a scratch.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:18.410
I don't care how injured I get so long as you're safe.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.820
There you go.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:20.710
What?

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:26.530
I'm rather clumsy, so I'm always getting hurt.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.310
That's why I always carry band-aids.

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:34.330
I'm really sorry. Please excuse me.

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:37.350
Cutie!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.580
That's her...

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.540
Do you mind, miss?

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.380
Go right ahead, sir.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:54.690
I am Elvis, adored by numbers and women.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.720
Elvis-sama, you're fantastic!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:12:00.250
He must be happy, too.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:04.330
He gets to wake up next to a cutie who takes good care of him.

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:08.280
Give me a card.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.100
Okay.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.660
No, not those cards.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:17.590
I want her friends.

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.260
A gate...

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.910
Cutie, I challenge you to a gate battle.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:32.320
A gate battle?

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.470
It's a gate battle!

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:36.040
We're going to witness a gate battle?

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:36.760
A gate battle...

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.410
I've never seen a gate before...

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:39.990
They're having a gate battle.

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.750
I understand if you don't want to fight.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:47.620
It's a tragedy to have to fight the man you love.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.820
Fate is cruel.

00:12:50.880 --> 00:12:53.610
What? I'm not...

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.340
Your eyes can't lie, cutie.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:59.360
Every girl falls in love with me.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.230
Isn't that right?

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.260
So will you.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.260
Listen, I'm not...

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:12.920
I'm such a terrible man.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:15.380
Sir, I'm not going to...

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:17.820
We accept your gate battle.

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:20.050
Nothing is more spectacular than a gate battle!

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:23.340
Who would refuse one?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.020
Hey!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.440
A gate battle?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.880
Rio, you can do it!

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.650
Why is everyone deciding for me?

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.560
This is quite an audience.

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.320
You don't get to see gate battles every day.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.500
What?

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.080
Rio!

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.650
What's going on?

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.440
What is that?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.310
A giant roulette?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:58.310
It's the gate battle ultimate roulette!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.750
Um...

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.670
Every dealer wishes to be a gate holder!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:08.640
In other words, those who hold gates carry their dreams!

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:12.260
Those who aren't prepared for that don't deserve to have gates.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:17.360
Such a person could never hope to be named the strongest dealer...

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:18.870
Owner...

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:20.550
I'll do it!

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.030
Well said!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.910
I've prepared your ceremonial outfit!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:25.780
Go and fight, Rio!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:26.670
Yes!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.280
Costume change!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:29.070
Yes!

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:50.250
This is that swimsuit from the poster!

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:53.910
It looks great on you, Rio!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:58.080
I was stupid to agree with you.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:02.000
Rio cosplays to become one with the game!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.580
That's amazing.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.720
She doesn't seem to be enjoying herself, though.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:07.920
You're really getting into this, cutie!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.170
I'll join you!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.790
Elvis, you're fantastic!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.120
That six pack is to die for!

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.870
What do you think, cutie?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.970
Do my charms have you reeling?

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.970
I'm reeling for an entirely different reason...

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:24.430
Look at this audience...

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:28.710
Well, you don't see gate battles every day.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.320
The rules are simple.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:33.320
One of you will throw the ball, and the other will bet.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:37.100
You'll bet once on red or black.

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:39.240
If the person betting is right, he wins.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.510
If he's wrong, the person throwing loses.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.690
Got it?

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:43.510
Yes.

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.890
Understood.

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.900
The dealer will be Ania.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.360
What? I'm not prepared for this!

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.350
Good luck!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.630
Luck.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:01.640
Rio-senpai, what should I do first?

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:05.160
First you'll decide who's betting and who's throwing.

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:09.700
Ladies first. Cutie, choose what you wish.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.410
Really?

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.960
I don't mind.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:16.870
Either way, it's fifty-fifty. My chances of winning are the same.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.340
Now choose.

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:23.450
Oh, you can't choose me, though.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:26.080
Okay, I will...

00:16:32.430 --> 00:16:34.860
I will bet.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.800
Then I will throw the ball.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:39.630
I've never played roulette like this before.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.100
I'd like to try throwing the ball a couple times. Do you mind?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.710
Go right ahead.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.210
How naive.

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.560
I'm no ordinary dealer. I'm a gate holder.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:56.870
On top of that, the numbers love me above all others.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:00.590
I can make the ball fall in the pocket of my choosing.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:03.840
Even if it's this giant roulette.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.960
Size doesn't matter.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:10.720
Only the speed of the roulette's rotation...

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.360
and the timing with which I throw the ball are important.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.770
Rotation speed 2.5 yards.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.840
Ball weight 14 pounds.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.800
Internal slope of the roulette 32 degrees.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:25.330
I almost forgot to include the cut on my finger in my calculations.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.460
Perfect...

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.160
Black 2!

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.360
Red 14!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.350
Black 29!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:46.970
Perfect...

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:49.700
Elvis-sama, you're amazing!

00:17:49.700 --> 00:17:52.300
Shall we begin, cutie?

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:56.770
Your gate is mine.

00:17:56.770 --> 00:18:01.940
The numbers love me above all others.

00:18:03.750 --> 00:18:06.250
We'll see about that.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:10.760
The goddess of numbers may not always be by your side.

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.570
You look cute when you're acting tough.

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.540
Elvis-sama!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:19.140
You can do it, Elvis-sama!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.590
Looks like everyone's ready.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:39.310
Let's begin!

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:46.910
You're both good dealers...

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:51.250
The goddess of numbers is smiling down on me.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:56.350
I choose you, cutie.

00:18:57.930 --> 00:19:00.760
With wind resistance, I'll release this 14 pound ball...

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.320
with a speed of 32...

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.920
at a 45 degree angle!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:10.890
Elvis-san throws the ball without hesitation!

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:15.760
Accelerated by the tube, the ball passes through the ramp in seconds...

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.760
Rio-senpai, place your bet!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.170
Red or black.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:30.560
Rio becomes one with everything.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.990
Its speed has increased 20%...

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:41.450
That's the spirit, cutie!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:46.780
Good return.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:49.010
But even that is...

00:19:49.010 --> 00:19:50.170
not enough.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:04.640
All numbers kneel before me!

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.290
Victory is mine!

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:10.270
The numbers favor all who love the game!

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:12.140
Hello.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.260
What?

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:16.220
Rio chooses Red 1!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:19.610
Red or black!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:21.290
Which will it be?

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:28.950
Red 1.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.200
Hooray!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.150
Hooray!

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:31.850
Ray.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.190
Hooray!

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:37.770
Impossible! My calculations were accurate...

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:41.780
That's impossible!

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:43.950
I won.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:47.080
Rio is the winner of the gate battle!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.150
Congratulations!

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.040
Rio!

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:54.280
Rio, congratulations!

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:55.370
Thank you.

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.870
Hold on a second!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.390
How awful.

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.370
Hey! Number 2121?

00:20:58.390 --> 00:20:59.680
How disillusioning.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:01.810
He's nothing without his gates.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.260
Come back, 1715!

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:03.390
Let's go.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.350
Hey!

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:05.990
Impossible...

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:09.510
How could my calculations lose to mere chance?

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.110
It wasn't chance!

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:17.270
Rio-senpai won this victory through her efforts.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:22.970
I'm sorry, but you'll have to let me collect your gate.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.950
The gate battle is over!

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:29.380
Let's have another round of applause for our contestants!

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.360
Another step closer...

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.790
Rio-senpai!

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:45.140
Look at this congratulatory cake!

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:47.180
Don't run!

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:29.540
An old castle, thunder, and rain!

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:31.840
Ania, you're dripping wet!

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.700
Rio-senpai, you're wet, too.

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:36.480
How did this happen?

00:23:36.180 --> 00:23:39.440
Misery

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:39.050
You can count on me in the next episode!
